node_id":"RA_kwDOHd1Zkc4Xt05J","name":"waveterm_0.14.5_arm64.snap","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":167866368,"digest":"sha256:1f85477f9ce538c819af78a43bf17c2dae84c5935d08f4c7c962b42b28b6fb55","download_count":42,"created_at":"2026-04-16T15:56:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:56:59Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/releases/download/v0.14.5/waveterm_0.14.5_arm64.snap"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavetermdev/waveterm/tarball/v0.14.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavetermdev/waveterm/zipball/v0.14.5","body":"Wave v0.14.5 introduces a new Process Viewer widget, Quake Mode for global hotkey, and several quality-of-life improvements.\r\n\r\n- **Process Viewer** - New widget that displays running processes on local and remote machines, with CPU and memory usage, sortable columns, and the ability to send signals to processes\r\n- **Quake Mode** - The global hotkey (`app:globalhotkey`) now toggles a Wave window visible and invisible\r\n- **[bugfix] Settings Widget** - Fixed a bug where config files that didn't exist yet couldn't be created or edited from the Settings widget UI\r\n- **Drag & Drop Files into Terminal** - Drag files from Finder (macOS) or your file manager into a terminal block to paste their quoted path ([#746](https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/issues/746))\r\n- New opt-in `app:showsplitbuttons` setting adds horizontal/vertical split buttons to block headers\r\n- Toggle the widgets sidebar from the View menu; visibility persists per workspace\r\n- F2 to rename the active tab\r\n- Mouse button 3/4 (back/forward) now navigate in web widgets\r\n- Terminal sessions now set `COLORTERM=truecolor` for better color support in CLI tools\r\n- [bugfix] Trim trailing whitespace from terminal clipboard copies\r\n- Package updates and dependency upgrades\r\n\r\n## PRs\r\n* First Cut at a new ProcessViewer Widget by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3137\r\n* updates to make processviewer more robust by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3144\r\n* feat: drag and drop file paths into terminal by @JustHereToHelp in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/2857\r\n* new keybindng F2 to edit the active tab name, also fix refocus after name editing by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3158\r\n* fix: Mouse Back/Forward support in webviews + few bugfixes by @mswiszcz in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3141\r\n* feat: add widgets sidebar toggle button to view menu by @mswiszcz in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3140\r\n* docs: add Traditional Chinese (zh-TW) README translation by @JaiJun in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3157\r\n* Bump brace-expansion from 1.1.12 to 1.1.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3139\r\n* Bump google.golang.org/api from 0.271.0 to 0.273.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3132\r\n* Bump electron from 41.0.2 to 41.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3133\r\n* Turns app:globalhotkey into a dedicated quake mode by @Midnight145 in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3151\r\n* feat: add opt-in split buttons to block headers by @lucyfarnik in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3159\r\n* Bump actions/deploy-pages from 4 to 5 in /.github/workflows by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3131\r\n* Bump github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3 from 1.14.37 to 1.14.40 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3176\r\n* Bump github.com/shirou/gopsutil/v4 from 4.26.2 to 4.26.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3177\r\n* remove unused deps from package.json by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3179\r\n* Bump google.golang.org/api from 0.273.0 to 0.274.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3175\r\n* Bump vite from 6.4.1 to 6.4.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3190\r\n* remove electron deps from about.tsx by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3194\r\n* Bump golang.org/x/sys from 0.42.0 to 0.43.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3208\r\n* remove old waveai backend code by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3195\r\n* fix notfound error in settings by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3212\r\n* Bump google.golang.org/api from 0.274.0 to 0.275.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3209\r\n* fix: trim trailing whitespace from terminal clipboard copies by @Drew-Goddyn in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3167\r\n* batch wsh:run tevents by hour by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3181\r\n* fix connstatus in new processviewer widget by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3222\r\n* Bump @xmldom/xmldom from 0.8.11 to 0.8.12 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3161\r\n* add docs for new term:showsplitbuttons config key by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3160\r\n* add v0.14.5 release notes and onboarding by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3223\r\n* Lots of fixes, big and small for processviewer (frontend and backend) by @sawka in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3224\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @JustHereToHelp made their first contribution in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/2857\r\n* @mswiszcz made their first contribution in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3141\r\n* @JaiJun made their first contribution in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3157\r\n* @Midnight145 made their first contribution in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3151\r\n* @lucyfarnik made their first contribution in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3159\r\n* @Drew-Goddyn made their first contribution in https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/pull/3167\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wavetermdev/waveterm/compare/v0.14.4...v0.14.5","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavetermdev/waveterm/releases/309929512/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":8}